# Checkouts materialize LF on every platform. Every generator and gate in this
# repository emits and compares LF, and the test loader's hashbang handling
# cannot parse a shebang line that ends in CRLF: under a core.autocrlf checkout
# nearly every test file importing from scripts/ (34 of the 42 scripts carry
# shebangs, and the failure follows the import graph) failed to collect with a
# bare SyntaxError while the rest of the run printed a green-looking tail.
# The eol attribute overrides core.autocrlf, so a clean clone behaves the
# same with or without that global setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
